note right of GTIOR
  **GitTextIOR — NOT in Unit 0.3.23.x**

  IOR format: ior:git:text:{url}#{positioning}

  Positioning formats:
  • #L42          (single line)
  • #L42:15-67:23 (line:col range)
  • #L1250-1890   (char range)

  Enables tracking origin of code
  at sub-file granularity.

  Sprint 1 Task 7: Must port to 0.3.23.x
end note

note bottom of DU
  **Unit 0.3.0.5 vs 0.3.23.x — Key Differences**

  <color:red>0.3.0.5 HAS / 0.3.23.x MISSING:</color>
  • GitTextIOR (git origin tracking)
  • Unified references[] (not split arrays)
  • discover/find/list (search operations)
  • Bidirectional sync (copy detection)
  • Folder support (°folder.unit)
  • rename/renameLink
  • Terminal identity (setTerminalIdentity)
  • UUIDv4 value object
  • DefaultStorage (own, not shared)
  • UnitCLI create/classify commands

  <color:green>0.3.23.x HAS / 0.3.0.5 MISSING:</color>
  • UnitDiscoveryService (auto-discovery)
  • ScenarioService (migration + CRUD)
  • ComponentManifest generation
  • @web4x/ucp integration (extends UcpComponent)
end note

